#: ../command-line.rst:3
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Naredbeni redak"

#: ../command-line.rst:7
msgid "Galette now proposes a command line interface to manage some tasks. This is accessible through the ``bin/console`` script in Galette root directory:"
msgstr ""
"Galette sada nudi sučelje naredbenog retka za obavljanje nekih zadataka. "
"Dostupno je putem skripte ``bin/console`` u korijenskoj mapi Galettea:"

#: ../command-line.rst:48
msgid "Some of those commands are meant for developers only (``galette:check-routes``, ``galette:headers:check``, ``galette:seed-fixtures``, ``galette:twig-pot-references``), and are not described here."
msgstr ""
"Neke su naredbe namijenjene samo razvojnim programerima (``galette:check-"
"routes``, ``galette:headers:check``, ``galette:seed-fixtures``, "
"``galette:twig-pot-references``) i ovdje nisu opisane."

#: ../command-line.rst:50
msgid "You can obtain help for a specific command by using the ``help`` command:"
msgstr "Pomoć za određenu naredbu možete dobiti naredbom ``help``:"

#: ../command-line.rst:57
msgid "Requirements check"
msgstr "Provjera zahtjeva"

#: ../command-line.rst:59
msgid "This only check for Galette prerequisites, and has no specific arguments."
msgstr "Provjerava samo preduvjete za Galette i nema posebnih argumenata."

#: ../command-line.rst:63
msgid "On some systems, PHP configuration may differ between cli and web; therefore it's recommended to check for requirements from the web script ``compat_test.php``."
msgstr ""
"Na nekim sustavima konfiguracija PHP-a može se razlikovati između naredbenog "
"retka i mrežnog poslužitelja. Zato se preporučuje provjera zahtjeva mrežnom "
"skriptom ``compat_test.php``."

#: ../command-line.rst:66
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalacija"

#: ../command-line.rst:68
msgid "This command obviously installs Galette :)"
msgstr "Ova naredba instalira Galette :)"

#: ../command-line.rst:97
msgid "By default, the script will check for an existing configuration file, you can ignore that using the ``--ignore-config`` option."
msgstr ""
"Skripta zadano provjerava postoji li konfiguracijska datoteka. Tu provjeru "
"možete preskočiti mogućnošću ``--ignore-config``."

#: ../command-line.rst:99
msgid "Required options that have not been provided on script call will be asked interactively."
msgstr ""
"Obvezne mogućnosti koje nisu navedene pri pozivu skripte zatražit će se "
"interaktivno."

#: ../command-line.rst:149
msgid "Super administrator password"
msgstr "Lozinka glavnog administratora"

#: ../command-line.rst:153
msgid "The super administrator password is normally changed from **My account**, then **My information**, or from the :ref:`advanced configuration <advanced_config>` page. Both require to be logged in, which is of little help the day the password is lost: the super administrator is not a member, so it cannot use the *forgotten password* form either."
msgstr ""
"Lozinka glavnog administratora obično se mijenja putem **Moj račun**, zatim "
"**Moji podaci**, ili na stranici :ref:`naprednih postavki <advanced_config>"
"`. Oba načina zahtijevaju prijavu, što ne pomaže ako zaboravite lozinku: "
"glavni administrator nije član pa ne može koristiti ni obrazac *Zaboravili "
"ste lozinku?*."

#: ../command-line.rst:155
msgid "This command is the way back in. It runs on the machine hosting Galette, and that access stands as the authentication."
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba omogućuje ponovni pristup. Pokreće se na računalu na kojem je "
"Galette smješten, a pristup tom računalu služi kao potvrda ovlasti."

#: ../command-line.rst:175
msgid "There is no option to pass the password with: it is only ever read from a hidden prompt, so that it does not end up in your shell history nor in the process list of the machine. It is asked twice, and the two answers must match."
msgstr ""
"Ne postoji mogućnost prosljeđivanja lozinke kao argumenta: čita se "
"isključivo skrivenim unosom kako ne bi završila u povijesti naredbi ili "
"popisu procesa. Unosi se dvaput i oba unosa moraju biti jednaka."

#: ../command-line.rst:194
msgid "The login is displayed so you know which account you just changed, but the command does not touch it. Change it from **My account**, then **My information**, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Korisničko ime prikazuje se kako biste znali koji ste račun izmijenili, ali "
"ga naredba ne mijenja. Promijenite ga uobičajeno putem **Moj račun**, zatim "
"**Moji podaci**."

#: ../command-line.rst:196
msgid "The new password must satisfy the :ref:`password rules <password_rules>` of your instance, exactly as it would from the web interface."
msgstr ""
"Nova lozinka mora ispunjavati :ref:`pravila za lozinke <password_rules>` "
"vaše instalacije, jednako kao pri promjeni putem mrežnog sučelja."

#: ../command-line.rst:201
msgid "Mailing queue"
msgstr "Red za slanje e-pošte"

#: ../command-line.rst:205
msgid "When :ref:`sending limits <mail_throttling>` are configured, mass mailings and reminders are queued rather than sent in one go. This command drains what is pending:"
msgstr ""
"Ako su postavljena :ref:`ograničenja slanja <mail_throttling>`, skupne "
"poruke i podsjetnici dodaju se u red umjesto da se šalju odjednom. Ova "
"naredba obrađuje poruke na čekanju:"

#: ../command-line.rst:220
msgid "Nothing is sent until that question is answered. Pass ``--force`` to skip it, which is what an unattended run needs: without it, a non-interactive call has no way to confirm and stops with an error rather than send."
msgstr ""
"Ništa se ne šalje dok ne odgovorite na to pitanje. Dodajte ``--force`` za "
"preskakanje potvrde, što je potrebno pri nenadziranom izvršavanju: bez toga "
"neinteraktivni poziv ne može potvrditi slanje pa završava pogreškom."

#: ../command-line.rst:226
msgid "For more complete documentation, see :ref:`draining the mail queue <mailing_queue_cron>`, and the :ref:`progress page <mailing_queue>` it drains alongside."
msgstr ""
"Potpuniji opis nalazi se u odjeljku :ref:`obrada reda za slanje e-pošte "
"<mailing_queue_cron>` i na :ref:`stranici napretka slanja <mailing_queue>`, "
"koja usporedno obrađuje isti red."

#: ../command-line.rst:229
msgid "Plugins commands"
msgstr "Naredbe za dodatke"

#: ../command-line.rst:231
msgid "You can list existing plugins using the ``galette:plugins:list`` command:"
msgstr "Postojeće dodatke možete navesti naredbom ``galette:plugins:list``:"

#: ../command-line.rst:248
msgid "Available commands are:"
msgstr "Dostupne su naredbe:"

#: ../command-line.rst:250
msgid "``galette:plugins:disable``: disable a plugin"
msgstr "``galette:plugins:disable``: isključi dodatak"

#: ../command-line.rst:251
msgid "``galette:plugins:enable``: enable a plugin"
msgstr "``galette:plugins:enable``: uključi dodatak"

#: ../command-line.rst:252
msgid "``galette:plugins:install-db``: install a plugin database"
msgstr "``galette:plugins:install-db``: instaliraj bazu podataka dodatka"

#: ../command-line.rst:256
msgid "Plugin database installation will remove any existing plugin tables!"
msgstr ""
"Instalacija baze podataka dodatka uklonit će sve postojeće tablice tog "
"dodatka!"

#: ../command-line.rst:258
msgid "For every plugin related command, you can precise which plugin(s) you want to act on, use the ``--all`` flag or either rely on interactive mode:"
msgstr ""
"Za svaku naredbu povezanu s dodacima možete navesti dodatke na koje se "
"odnosi, koristiti oznaku ``--all`` ili se osloniti na interaktivni način:"
